---
config:
  theme: default
description: >-
  legend on with tag styles: a row for each style with a fill or a stroke whose tag an element or
  relation carries (those colours on its swatch), none for the style `store` (no colour), for the
  unused tag `legacy` or for the style of a kind
---
c4-beta container
legend on
style critical fill:#b91c1c, stroke:#7f1d1d
style async stroke:#0a7a3d, line:dashed
style store shape:cylinder
style legacy fill:#999999
style container fill:#0b5cab
person clerk "Ledger Clerk" "Posts journal entries."
softwareSystem ledger "Ledger" {
  container api "Ledger API" "Keeps the books." "Rust" :::critical
  container books "Books" "Stores the entries." "PostgreSQL" :::store
}
clerk --> api : "Posts entries using" "HTTPS"
api --> books : "Writes to" :::async
